        {
            "jpName": "ファインモーション",
            "enName": "Fine Motion",
            "jpText": "商店街へ視察――じゃなくて……\r\n散策、しに行ってみようかな？\nそれとも、四つ葉のクローバー探しとか？",
            "enText": "I could go into town and people-watch— \nI mean, take a stroll… Or maybe I could \nsearch for a four-leaf clover?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -1020327344317168549,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ファインモーション",
            "enName": "Fine Motion",
            "jpText": "ふふっ、行き先に悩むなんて……\r\nすっごくすっごくワクワクしちゃうな！",
            "enText": "Hehe, it's so fun thinking about what to do!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -8220177735557413893,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ファインモーション",
            "enName": "Fine Motion",
            "jpText": "よーし、決めた！　どっちもやっちゃおう！\r\n四つ葉のクローバーを探して、\nそれから商店街に行こうっと♪",
            "enText": "All right, I've decided! I'll do both! \nFirst I'll find a four-leaf clover, \nthen I'll go into town!♪",
